{"meta":{"id":"xml-bean","category":"it/syntax/spring/bean","title":"xml bean (생성 · 주입) · Spring","subtitle":"(SPRING)","summary":"bean id · class, property value · ref, ClassPathXmlApplicationContext.getBean","tags":["spring","f-config","f-constructor"],"color":"amber","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-amber","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-amber-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-amber-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span>SPRING</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">xml bean (생성 · 주입) · Spring</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> bean id · class, property value · ref, ClassPathXmlApplicationContext.getBean</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">xml 로 객체(bean) 만들기 · 값 넣기</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">xml</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;!-- src/main/resources/xml/sungjuk.xml --&gt;\r\n&lt;beans xmlns=&quot;http://www.springframework.org/schema/beans&quot;\r\n       xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;\r\n       xsi:schemaLocation=&quot;http://www.springframework.org/schema/beans\r\n                           http://www.springframework.org/schema/beans/spring-beans.xsd&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;bean id=&quot;serviceA&quot; class=&quot;com.spring.sExam.ServiceA&quot; /&gt;\r\n\r\n  &lt;bean id=&quot;vo&quot; class=&quot;com.spring.sExam.exam1207.SungjukVO&quot;&gt;   &lt;!-- 변수 생성 --&gt;\r\n    &lt;property name=&quot;name&quot; value=&quot;홍길동&quot; /&gt;                     &lt;!-- setter 로 값 삽입 --&gt;\r\n    &lt;property name=&quot;kor&quot; value=&quot;100&quot; /&gt;\r\n    &lt;property name=&quot;serviceA&quot; ref=&quot;serviceA&quot; /&gt;                &lt;!-- 다른 bean 연결 (ref) --&gt;\r\n  &lt;/bean&gt;\r\n&lt;/beans&gt;</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">java 에서 꺼내 쓰기</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">ClassPathXmlApplicationContext ctx = new ClassPathXmlApplicationContext(&quot;xml/sungjuk.xml&quot;);  // 대소문자 구분 X\r\n\r\nSungjukVO vo = (SungjukVO) ctx.getBean(&quot;vo&quot;);\r\nvo.sungjukCalc();\r\nvo.getServiceA().run();\r\n\r\nSungjukVO[] vos = { (SungjukVO) ctx.getBean(&quot;vo1&quot;), (SungjukVO) ctx.getBean(&quot;vo2&quot;) };\r\nctx.close();</pre></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">bean 은 기본 싱글톤 — 같은 id 는 한 번만 선언하면 계속 같은 객체를 돌려준다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">value 는 값, ref 는 다른 bean — 객체를 직접 new 하지 않고 주입(DI) 받는다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-amber-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">요즘은 @Component · @Autowired (어노테이션) 방식을 주로 사용</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> Java › 생성자, TypeScript › static (싱글톤)</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/spring/bean/xml-bean","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"spring","title":"SPRING","path":"it/syntax/spring"},{"id":"bean","title":"Bean · Lombok","path":"it/syntax/spring/bean"}],"hasImage":false}